[node name="Body" type="Label" parent="Controls/Margin/Rows"]
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 22
theme_override_colors/font_color = Color(0.82, 0.86, 0.95, 1)
text = "Gamepad     stick or d-pad move    A jump    LT dodge
                     X light    Y heavy    RB launcher
                     B grab and interact    LB block
                     RT signature    R3 ultimate

Keyboard      WASD move    SPACE jump    SHIFT dodge
                     J light    K heavy    L launcher
                     U grab    E interact    CTRL block
                     Q signature    R ultimate

Light three times is punch, punch, KICK -- and the kick throws a
fireball if the blue meter can pay for it.

Grab beats block. Block beats strikes. Strikes beat grabs.

In the air, light is a jump kick and heavy is a slam that bursts
where you land.

Interact picks things up. Press it again to throw them. What you
are allowed to lift depends on your ninja's STRENGTH."

[node name="Back" type="Label" parent="Controls/Margin/Rows"]
size_flags_vertical = 8
theme_override_colors/font_color = Color(0.5, 0.55, 0.66, 1)
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 19
text = "[ESC] or [B] to go back"
